; ── Lilina · A Message from the Creator ───────────────────────────────────────
; One-time special event — Lilina disappears after this dialogue (resets on game restart)

@stopBgm
@bgm stardust
@back bg02 time:0.5
@char 莉莉娜 pos:50 time:0

莉莉娜: ...Mm. You found me.

@choice "You... who are you?" goto:.intro_chat
@stop

# intro_chat
莉莉娜: I am the one behind this story.

; ════════════════════════════════
; ▼ Write your creator's message below ▼
; ════════════════════════════════

莉莉娜: Thank you for coming to this world.

莉莉娜: -- Please fill in your message here --

; ════════════════════════════════
; ▲ Creator's message ends ▲
; ════════════════════════════════

莉莉娜: ...I must go. I hope this warmth stays with you.

@hide 莉莉娜
@setLilinaDone
@GotoMapDemo Scene:MapTest IsDay:0
@stop
